chat (V3-class), deepseek-reasoner (R1-class).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : fanar\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.fanar.qa/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : Fanar\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://api.fanar.qa/docs\r\nnotes     : QCRI (Qatar Computing Research Institute) Arabic-focused LLM. Other models: Fanar-C-1-8.7B, Fanar-C-2-27B, Fanar-S-1-7B, Fanar-Sadiq, Fanar-Oryx(?).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : openrouter\r\nbaseUrl   : https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://openrouter.ai/docs\r\nnotes     : Well-known aggregator, 415+ models, 17 currently :free-suffixed. GET /v1/models for current catalog since free list rotates.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : pollinations\r\nbaseUrl   : https://gen.pollinations.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : openai\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://enter.pollinations.ai/api/docs\r\nnotes     : Open-source gen-AI platform. Pricing in 'pollen' (their own free-tier currency). Model 'openai' is an alias/router. GET /v1/models for full catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : groq\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : openai/gpt-oss-20b\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://console.groq.com/docs/api-reference\r\nnotes     : Well-known legitimate provider (Groq Inc). No literal \\ model; free-tier accounts get rate-limited usage / starting credits. GET /v1/models for full current catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : nararouter\r\nbaseUrl   : https://router.bynara.id/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek-v4-pro-free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://router.bynara.id/keys\r\nnotes     : Site: Nara (bynara.id). Required Telegram-group join + relink at /settings before first use (one-time gate, now cleared). GET /v1/models for catalog; -free suffixed ids are genuinely free.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : orcarouter\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.orcarouter.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : orcarouter/free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.orcarouter.ai/introduction\r\nnotes     : OpenAI-compatible aggregator\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : tokenharbor\r\nbaseUrl   : https://tokenharbor.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek-v4-flash:free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://tokenharbor.ai/docs/api/curl\r\nnotes     : OpenAI-compatible; also has /v1/messages Anthropic-style endpoint. GET /v1/models for real callable model ids (vendor-prefixed names like tokenharbor/x are NOT callable). :free suffix models are truly free-tier.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : opencode\r\nbaseUrl   : https://opencode.ai/zen/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : None\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://opencode.ai/docs/zen/\r\nnotes     : OpenCode Zen gateway (from the OpenCode coding-agent CLI project). Multi-provider proxy -- OpenAI-compat at /v1/chat/completions works for this profile's protocol, but Zen also has native /v1/responses and /v1/messages paths for other SDKs. Free models (limited-time promo): big-pickle, deepseek-v4-flash-free, mimo-v2.5-free, hy3-free, laguna-s-2.1-free, nemotron-3-ultra-free, nemotron-3.5-lightning-free. NOTE: the 401 'Invalid API key' on generation endpoints was actually a no-credit-topped-up gate, not a bad key.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : openai\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.openai.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : gpt-5-nano\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_completion_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : None\r\ndocsUrl   : https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat\r\nnotes     : Official OpenAI API. GPT-5-family models require max_completion_tokens, not max_tokens.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : alibaba\r\nbaseUrl   : https://ws-uqwgkb2mtkfsqelb.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : qwen3.8-27b\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'DASHSCOPE_WORKSPACE_ID': 'ws-uqwgkb2mtkfsqelb', 'apiHost': 'ws-uqwgkb2mtkfsqelb.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com', 'dashscopeNativeEndpoint': 'https://ws-uqwgkb2mtkfsqelb.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/api/v1'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/developer-reference/compatibility-of-openai-with-dashscope\r\nnotes     : Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope), Singapore/ap-southeast-1 workspace. CORRECTED 2026-08-21: neither the generic dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com nor mainland dashscope.aliyuncs.com endpoint authenticates this key -- both return 401 'Incorrect API key provided' even with a valid key. This workspace is provisioned on a dedicated per-workspace domain (pattern: https://{workspaceId}.{region}.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1), confirmed working via a live GET /v1/models call returning 200 with a real model catalog (kimi-k3, qwen3.8-27b, ZHIPU/GLM-5.3, deepseek-v4-pro-0813, etc). If a future key is provisioned under the shared modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com intl console instead of a dedicated workspace, dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com may still be correct for that key -- verify per-key rather than assuming this workspace URL is universal.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : githubcopilot\r\nbaseUrl   : \r\nprotocol  : generic\r\ntestModel : \r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'verifyMethod': 'gh api user (with GH_TOKEN=<key>) for token validity/scopes; copilot skill for actual model access'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.github.com/en/copilot\r\nnotes     : No public/ToS-sanctioned direct chat-completions REST endpoint -- GitHub Copilot's actual inference API is internal/undocumented (editor-only, requires token exchange via copilot_internal/v2/token + spoofed editor headers), so it's out of scope for Test-ApiKey. To verify a token/subscription: (1) validate the raw ghp_/gho_ token via the PUBLIC 'GET https://api.github.com/user' endpoint with GH_TOKEN set -- checks validity + expiry + confirms 'copilot' OAuth scope via X-OAuth-Scopes header; (2) to actually exercise Copilot itself, use the 'copilot' skill (drives the real official CLI via acpx/ACP), NOT a raw HTTP call. Requires the official 'copilot' CLI (npm i -g @github/copilot) + 'copilot login' already done on the machine -- the CLI uses its own authenticated session, not necessarily the specific vault-stored token.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : mistral\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.mistral.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : mistral-small-latest\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.mistral.ai/api/\r\nnotes     : Official Mistral AI (La Plateforme). GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : huggingface\r\nbaseUrl   : https://router.huggingface.co/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-27B-AWQ-4bit:together\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/index\r\nnotes     : HF Inference Providers unified router -- pass-through pricing per underlying provider (together, fireworks-ai, nscale, novita, etc), no truly free-tier models found via /v1/models is_free flag except a couple \\-input ones. Model id format requires ':provider' suffix when multiple providers exist. Free accounts get a small monthly credit allowance.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : llm7\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.llm7.io/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.llm7.io/\r\nnotes     : Independent free/anonymous LLM aggregator -- base tier works with no key at 30 RPM, key from dash.llm7.io raises limits. No literal \\-priced model in /v1/models catalog despite being marketed as free; likely runs on a free credit allowance. GET /v1/models for catalog (43 models).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : ollama\r\nbaseUrl   : https://ollama.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : gpt-oss:20b\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.ollama.com/api/openai-compatibility\r\nnotes     : Ollama Cloud (hosted), NOT local Ollama -- local installs use http://localhost:11434/v1 with dummy key 'ollama' instead. Free daily usage allowance for cloud API. GET /v1/models for current catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : cerebras\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.cerebras.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : gpt-oss-120b\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/\r\nnotes     : Cerebras Cloud -- known for very fast wafer-scale inference. Free tier available. GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : nvidia\r\nbaseUrl   : https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/reference/llm-apis\r\nnotes     : NVIDIA NIM / build.nvidia.com. Model ids use 'org/model' format. GET /v1/models for full catalog (hundreds of models).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : aionlabs\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.aionlabs.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : aion-labs/aion-3.0-mini\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://www.aionlabs.ai/docs/api-reference/\r\nnotes     : AionLabs: unmoderated (is_moderated:false) models specifically tuned for roleplay/storytelling incl. mature/darker themes -- different content policy than most providers here. No \\ model; aion-3.0-mini is cheapest. GET /v1/models for catalog (note: response uses top-level 'models' key, not 'data').\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : cohere\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.cohere.ai/compatibility/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : command-r7b-12-2024\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.cohere.com/docs/compatibility-api\r\nnotes     : Official Cohere. Using their OpenAI-compatibility layer (/compatibility/v1) rather than native /v2/chat protocol. GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : agnes\r\nbaseUrl   : https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : agnes-2.0-flash\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://www.agnes-ai.com/en/docs/overview\r\nnotes     : Agnes AI (by Sapiens AI, Singapore) -- omni-modal gateway (text/image/video), currently free access. Also has image/video models (agnes-image-*, agnes-video-*) not usable via chat/completions.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : kilo\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.kilo.ai/api/gateway\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : kilo-auto/free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://kilo.ai/docs/gateway/api-reference\r\nnotes     : Kilo AI Gateway (from Kilo Code coding agent). Base URL has NO /v1 suffix -- path is /api/gateway/chat/completions directly. 362 models, 13 :free-suffixed incl. kilo-auto/free (their own auto-router) and passthrough openrouter/free.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : xai\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.x.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : grok-4-fast\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.x.ai/docs/api-reference\r\nnotes     : Official xAI (Grok) API.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : cloudflare\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/2ec79a93e438c679c8e91893952f99b3/ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : @cf/openai/gpt-oss-120b\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'accountId': '2ec79a93e438c679c8e91893952f99b3'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/get-started/rest-api/\r\nnotes     : Cloudflare Workers AI. Base URL is per-account (account ID embedded in path) -- see accountInfo.accountId. GET /v1/models NOT supported (405); use native GET /ai/models/search?task=Text%20Generation for catalog discovery instead, or POST directly to /v1/chat/completions. Some model ids in docs/examples are deprecated -- verify against models/search.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : sambanova\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.sambanova.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : Meta-Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.sambanova.ai/cloud/docs/get-started/overview\r\nnotes     : SambaNova Cloud -- known for fast custom-silicon inference. GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : nscale\r\nbaseUrl   : https://inference.api.nscale.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.nscale.com/docs/inference/serverless-models/overview\r\nnotes     : Nscale (European GPU cloud). No \\ model; Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 is cheapest. GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : anthropic\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.anthropic.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : anthropic\r\ntestModel : claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.anthropic.com/en/api/messages\r\nnotes     : Official Anthropic API. Native protocol uses x-api-key + anthropic-version headers, NOT Authorization: Bearer.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : chutes\r\nbaseUrl   : https://llm.chutes.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : unsloth/Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407-TEE\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'loginFingerprintId': '6SNAh4apJUSpNmUDjE1PxS63EiW88WU1'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://chutes.ai/docs/getting-started/quickstart\r\nnotes     : Chutes -- decentralized GPU compute network (Bittensor subnet 64), TEE (confidential compute) models. Pricing shown in both TAO (crypto) and USD. No \\ model in catalog; cheapest is Mistral-Nemo. Management/billing is at api.chutes.ai (separate from inference base URL).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : bigmodel\r\nbaseUrl   : https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : glm-4.5-air\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/model-overview\r\nnotes     : BigModel.cn -- Zhipu AI's official platform for GLM models (mainland China endpoint; international equivalent is z.ai). GET /v1/models for catalog.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : tabiai\r\nbaseUrl   : https://tabitoken.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : claude-opus-4-8\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://tabitoken.com/keys\r\nnotes     : Site is tabitoken.com (branded 'TabiAI'), runs on the New-API/One-API open-source gateway. Only 4 models exposed, all Claude Opus variants -- no free/cheap tier, be mindful of cost when testing. CAUTION: a trivial test prompt used 6554 prompt_tokens -- a large hidden system prompt is injected server-side (response metadata shows usage_source:anthropic/billing_usage.source:claude_messages, suggesting this proxies real Claude billing, possibly via a non-Developer-API client session). At Opus pricing this is NOT a negligible-cost test like other providers -- avoid casual re-testing.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : bai\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.b.ai/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek-v4-flash\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://chat.b.ai\r\nnotes     : Router exposing 42 models incl. Claude Opus 5/GPT-5.6/Gemini 3.1 Pro in its /v1/models catalog, but PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22: only 7 actually respond 200 on this key with zero deposit - minimax-m2.7, deepseek-v4-flash, deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp, qwen3.8-27b, hy3, mimo-v2.5, mimo-v2.5-pro. Every other listed model (Claude/GPT-5.x/Gemini/GLM-5.x/Kimi/MiniMax-M3/DeepSeek-v4-pro) returns 403 access_denied \"Deposit required to unlock premium models\" - the catalog is NOT an accurate guide to what's callable on a $0 balance, always probe with a real chat/completions call before trusting a listed id. Free tier is also heavily rate-limited (429s under light concurrent load; single sequential calls ~2-8s apart clear it).\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : commandcode\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.commandcode.ai/provider/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://commandcode.ai/docs/provider\r\nnotes     : From Command Code (a coding-agent CLI, like Claude Code/Codex) - this is its genuinely documented, publicly-published provider API (found at /docs/provider), NOT an internal/reverse-engineered endpoint - unlike GitHub Copilot's situation. OpenAI-compat /chat/completions + native Anthropic /messages (Claude model ids MUST use /messages, they 400 on /chat/completions with a pointer to the right endpoint) + GET /models. 58 models listed. PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22 despite the \"free\" credential name: ALL 58 models, on BOTH endpoints, return 400 \"insufficient credits - purchase more credits\" - this account has a genuinely $0 balance and nothing is callable yet. Pay-as-you-go, no markup on underlying rates per their docs - needs a funded balance before any model works, same requiresBalance shape as chutes/opencode.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : gorouter\r\nbaseUrl   : https://gorouter.app/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : claude-opus-4-8\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://gorouter.app/\r\nnotes     : PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22: GET /v1/models returns only 4 models, all Claude Opus variants (claude-opus-5, claude-opus-5-thinking, claude-opus-4-8, claude-opus-4-8-thinking) - no free/cheap tier, same shape as tabiai. No pricing fields on the model objects at all. Did NOT probe chat/completions live - tabiai's equivalent proxy injected a large hidden system prompt and billed real Claude usage per-call, so treat a first real call here as similarly non-negligible-cost until proven otherwise. docsUrl is best-guess root domain only - /docs, /docs/api, /api, /keys all returned bot-blocked 403 via curl, could not confirm an actual docs page.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : veniceai\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.venice.ai/api/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : venice-uncensored-1-2\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://docs.venice.ai/api-reference/endpoint/chat/completions\r\nnotes     : Official Venice AI - privacy-focused inference, several models explicitly marketed as uncensored/unmoderated (venice-uncensored-1-2, venice-uncensored-role-play) - different content policy than most providers here, similar caution to aionlabs. GET /v1/models: 113 models, real usd/diem pricing per model (model_spec.pricing), no zero-cost entries found. PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22: the bare id \"venice-uncensored\" from Venice's own docs example does NOT exist in the live catalog (only the -1-2 and -role-play suffixed variants do - docs example is stale). Key authenticates fine (/v1/models 200) but POST /v1/chat/completions 400s \"Insufficient USD or Diem balance\" - this account has $0 balance, same requiresBalance shape as chutes/opencode/commandcode.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : bluesminds\r\nbaseUrl   : https://api.bluesminds.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://api.bluesminds.com/\r\nnotes     : OpenAI-compatible aggregator, 27 models incl. NVIDIA Nemotron family, Meta Llama, GPT-5.x, DeepSeek, Kimi. PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22: GET /v1/models 200 (27 models) AND a real POST /v1/chat/completions call on meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct succeeded with actual content on this free-tier key - genuinely callable, not just a catalog listing.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : agentrouter\r\nbaseUrl   : https://agentrouter.org/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : gpt-5.6-sol\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://agentrouter.org/docs\r\nnotes     : AgentRouter (agentrouter.org) - non-profit OpenAI/Anthropic-compatible gateway, 3 models (claude-opus-4-8, claude-opus-5, gpt-5.6-sol). PROBED LIVE 2026-08-22: key authenticates; GET /v1/models 200; POST /v1/chat/completions on gpt-5.6-sol 200 with real content. WAF REQUIRED: every request must carry Originator + User-Agent headers (Originator: codex_cli_rs, User-Agent: codex_cli_rs/0.101.0 (Mac OS 26.0.1; arm64) Apple_Terminal/464, Version optional) or the API returns 401 'unauthorized client detected'. SUPPORTED 2026-08-22: harness BackendSpec now has a per-backend 'headers' map applied to discovery + chat requests, and .maestro/backends.json's agentrouter-free entry carries the WAF headers - live discovery and chat both verified working through the harness.\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : aihubmix\r\nbaseUrl   : https://aihubmix.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : coding-glm-5.2-free\r\nreqBalance: True\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'console': 'https://console.aihubmix.com/token', 'balanceNote': 'insufficient_user_quota on paid models until recharged'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://doc.aihubmix.com/\r\nnotes     : OpenAI-compatible multi-provider gateway (401 models). Paid models need account balance; *-free models work without credit. Reasoning models need max_tokens >= ~512 or content comes back empty with finish_reason=length. Key console: https://console.aihubmix.com/token\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : youcom\r\nbaseUrl   : https://ydc-index.io/v1\r\nprotocol  : generic\r\ntestModel : \r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'freeCredits': '$100 complimentary on new accounts', 'platform': 'https://you.com/platform', 'endpoints': '/v1/search, /v1/answer, /v1/research, /v1/contents'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://you.com/docs/using-the-api/authentication\r\nnotes     : Web-search/research API, NOT an LLM chat provider - no /chat/completions or /models endpoint (both 403). POST /v1/search with {\"query\": \"...\"} verified working. Not usable as a maestro backend. Platform: https://you.com/platform\r\n======================================================================\r\nprovider  : nousresearch\r\nbaseUrl   : https://inference-api.nousresearch.com/v1\r\nprotocol  : openai\r\ntestModel : upstage/solar-pro4:free\r\nreqBalance: False\r\nmaxTokens : max_tokens\r\nacctInfo  : {'org': '92c52757', 'freeModels': 'ids ending in :free (solar-pro4, laguna-s-2.1, laguna-xs-2.1, hy3, step-3.7-flash, longcat-2.0)', 'portal': 'https://portal.nousresearch.com/orgs/92c52757/api-keys'}\r\ndocsUrl   : https://portal.nousresearch.com/orgs/92c52757/api-keys\r\nnotes     : OpenAI-compatible inference gateway, OpenRouter-style model ids (vendor/model, some with :free suffix). 370 models incl. nousresearch/hermes-4-70b and hermes-4-405b. Verified: solar-pro4:free, laguna-s-2.1:free, longcat-2.0:free, hermes-4-70b all answer at max_tokens=10. Mandatory-reasoning models (tencent/hy3:free, laguna-xs-2.1:free) burn the budget on reasoning tokens and return empty content at finish_reason=length unless max_tokens is generous (>=512). Host is inference-api.nousresearch.com; api.nousresearch.com does not resolve.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f4bda91b-2c7d-4a50-8d26-1b4ec99e5997","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\osami\\.uw\\keysync","sessionId":"76ac34d9-c9e8-43f4-8cfa-18bf9783c39c","version":"2.1.257","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"curious-crafting-coral"}
