{"parentUuid":"31256b37-452f-415f-ab80-06ab3cb72ff6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a82676fb3de9cba9f","message":{"model":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeeF3KAdFYHhHrMtVnqno","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NYNqhF4AQGEgxAK8XW3WKu","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/","prompt":"Does Cloudflare Workers AI publish a machine-readable model catalogue including pricing? What is the API endpoint for listing models (accounts/{id}/ai/models/search), and what fields does each model return - does it include a \"properties\" array, pricing/price array with unit and price, task, description, context window? Also: is there a free allocation (Neurons) per day?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2461,"cache_read_input_tokens":186473,"output_tokens":558,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":215},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2461},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":558,"cache_read_input_tokens":186473,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2461,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2461,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CeeF3HcMhg9mc84Y9Mw2a","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"e53948b0-4eb5-4c8b-906a-ba4eefc1e385","timestamp":"2026-09-02T07:47:10.329Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\osami\\.uw\\keysync","sessionId":"76ac34d9-c9e8-43f4-8cfa-18bf9783c39c","version":"2.1.257","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"curious-crafting-coral"}
{"parentUuid":"31256b37-452f-415f-ab80-06ab3cb72ff6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"355cfc4f-9d72-4bb3-8805-f2dd57c05477","agentId":"a82676fb3de9cba9f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M9QeV6aSkgDtMRctysfcsM","type":"tool_result","content":"Per model, the endpoint returns four fields: `\"id\"`, `\"object\"`, `\"created\"`, and `\"owned_by\"`. The top-level response wraps these in `\"object\"` (always `\"list\"`) and `\"data\"`, described as \"An array of model objects.\"\n\nField meanings, per the docs:\n- `id` — \"The model identifier, which can be referenced in the API endpoints.\"\n- `object` — \"The object type, which is always `model`.\"\n- `created` — \"The Unix timestamp (in seconds) of when the model was created.\"\n- `owned_by` — \"The organization that owns the model.\"\n\n**No pricing, context window, or free-tier fields are returned.** The documentation makes no mention of token costs, maximum context length, rate limits, or tier eligibility. The sample response confirms this, showing only the four fields for each entry (e.g. `\"id\": \"gpt-oss-120b\"`, `\"owned_by\": \"Cerebras\"`).\n\nWorth noting: the `created` values in the example are both `0`, so that timestamp may not carry meaningful information in practice."}]},"uuid":"cd77b749-fa75-49eb-bba3-d76a7f1ba1f1","timestamp":"2026-09-02T07:47:19.689Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":2149,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Per model, the endpoint returns four fields: `\"id\"`, `\"object\"`, `\"created\"`, and `\"owned_by\"`. The top-level response wraps these in `\"object\"` (always `\"list\"`) and `\"data\"`, described as \"An array of model objects.\"\n\nField meanings, per the docs:\n- `id` — \"The model identifier, which can be referenced in the API endpoints.\"\n- `object` — \"The object type, which is always `model`.\"\n- `created` — \"The Unix timestamp (in seconds) of when the model was created.\"\n- `owned_by` — \"The organization that owns the model.\"\n\n**No pricing, context window, or free-tier fields are returned.** The documentation makes no mention of token costs, maximum context length, rate limits, or tier eligibility. The sample response confirms this, showing only the four fields for each entry (e.g. `\"id\": \"gpt-oss-120b\"`, `\"owned_by\": \"Cerebras\"`).\n\nWorth noting: the `created` values in the example are both `0`, so that timestamp may not carry meaningful information in practice.","durationMs":8049,"url":"https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/api-reference/models"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"31256b37-452f-415f-ab80-06ab3cb72ff6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\osami\\.uw\\keysync","sessionId":"76ac34d9-c9e8-43f4-8cfa-18bf9783c39c","version":"2.1.257","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"curious-crafting-coral"}
{"parentUuid":"e53948b0-4eb5-4c8b-906a-ba4eefc1e385","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"355cfc4f-9d72-4bb3-8805-f2dd57c05477","agentId":"a82676fb3de9cba9f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NYNqhF4AQGEgxAK8XW3WKu","type":"tool_result","content":"The page provided doesn't answer most of your questions. It's the human-readable model catalogue browser, not the API reference.\n\n**What the page does show:**\n- A browsable catalogue listing \"86 models\" on Workers AI, each with a name, author (Meta, Google, Qwen, DeepSeek, OpenAI, Deepgram, etc.), a task type (Text Generation, Text Embeddings, Text-to-Image, Automatic Speech Recognition, Summarization, Translation, Object Detection, Image Classification, Voice Activity Detection, Image-to-Text, Image-Text-to-Text, Text Classification, Text-to-Speech), a short description, and capability tags such as \"Cloudflare-hosted\", \"Batch\", \"Partner\", \"Real-time\", \"Function calling\", \"Reasoning\", \"Vision\", \"LoRA\", \"Beta\", and \"Deprecated\".\n- Machine-readable entry points that are referenced: a Markdown version of the page at `/workers-ai/models/index.md`, and a documentation index at `https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/llms.txt`, described as a way to \"discover all available pages before exploring further.\"\n- A pointer to a broader catalogue: \"Check out the [unified AI model catalog]\" covering \"more models, including external providers.\"\n\n**What is not covered here:**\n- The `accounts/{id}/ai/models/search` REST endpoint isn't mentioned, so I can't confirm from this content whether the response objects contain a `properties` array, a pricing/`price` array with `unit` and `price` keys, or an explicit context-window field. (Context length appears only inside prose descriptions on this page — e.g. one model is described as having a \"131,072 token context window\" — not as a structured field.)\n- No pricing figures appear, and there is nothing about Neurons or a daily free allocation.\n\nFor the schema and the free-tier Neuron quota, you'd need Cloudflare's Workers AI REST API reference and its pricing/limits pages rather than this catalogue page."}]},"uuid":"6c6dd44a-e23e-45fc-b6f2-91dfaf75a615","timestamp":"2026-09-02T07:47:24.405Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":37727,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The page provided doesn't answer most of your questions. It's the human-readable model catalogue browser, not the API reference.\n\n**What the page does show:**\n- A browsable catalogue listing \"86 models\" on Workers AI, each with a name, author (Meta, Google, Qwen, DeepSeek, OpenAI, Deepgram, etc.), a task type (Text Generation, Text Embeddings, Text-to-Image, Automatic Speech Recognition, Summarization, Translation, Object Detection, Image Classification, Voice Activity Detection, Image-to-Text, Image-Text-to-Text, Text Classification, Text-to-Speech), a short description, and capability tags such as \"Cloudflare-hosted\", \"Batch\", \"Partner\", \"Real-time\", \"Function calling\", \"Reasoning\", \"Vision\", \"LoRA\", \"Beta\", and \"Deprecated\".\n- Machine-readable entry points that are referenced: a Markdown version of the page at `/workers-ai/models/index.md`, and a documentation index at `https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/llms.txt`, described as a way to \"discover all available pages before exploring further.\"\n- A pointer to a broader catalogue: \"Check out the [unified AI model catalog]\" covering \"more models, including external providers.\"\n\n**What is not covered here:**\n- The `accounts/{id}/ai/models/search` REST endpoint isn't mentioned, so I can't confirm from this content whether the response objects contain a `properties` array, a pricing/`price` array with `unit` and `price` keys, or an explicit context-window field. (Context length appears only inside prose descriptions on this page — e.g. one model is described as having a \"131,072 token context window\" — not as a structured field.)\n- No pricing figures appear, and there is nothing about Neurons or a daily free allocation.\n\nFor the schema and the free-tier Neuron quota, you'd need Cloudflare's Workers AI REST API reference and its pricing/limits pages rather than this catalogue page.","durationMs":11291,"url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e53948b0-4eb5-4c8b-906a-ba4eefc1e385","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\osami\\.uw\\keysync","sessionId":"76ac34d9-c9e8-43f4-8cfa-18bf9783c39c","version":"2.1.257","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"curious-crafting-coral"}
